flowchart TD
    A[Simulated Attacks Library] -->|Create New Asset| B[Create New Asset page: 3 tabs]
    A -->|Empty state CTA| B
    A -->|View-only role| VO[View-only library, no Create action]

    B -- Generate with AI --> C1[Setup: name + prompt/chips + motive + sender + difficulty]
    B -- Create Manually --> C2[Blank WYSIWYG: name + sender + subject + body + difficulty]
    B -- Upload EML File --> C3[Setup: name + .eml upload + optional screenshot + difficulty]

    C1 -->|Generate Asset| D[Generating: Analyzing to Ready]
    C3 -->|Upload| D
    D --> E{Result}
    E -- Success ~10s --> F[Edit and Preview: WYSIWYG + redaction banner + desktop/mobile toggle]
    E -- Failure --> Derr[Inline error, Try again, inputs preserved]
    Derr --> D
    C2 --> F

    F --> AL{Add attack vector?}
    AL -- Add Phishing Link --> L1[Select display text]
    L1 --> L2[Popover: link text + landing destination + tracked safe URL]
    L2 -- Insert link --> L3[Tracked-link token + confirmation]
    L2 -- Cancel --> F
    L3 --> F
    AL -- Add QR code --> F
    AL -- No --> G{Change difficulty?}

    G -- No --> H[Manual edits in canvas]
    G -- Yes, click Regenerate --> I[Confirm: discard edits and regenerate?]
    I -- Cancel --> F
    I -- Confirm --> D

    H --> J[Click Save Asset]
    J --> M{Duplicate name in workspace?}
    M -- Yes --> Merr[Inline validation error, rename required]
    Merr --> J
    M -- No --> N[Saved to Simulated Attacks Library, Custom Assets tab]

    N --> O[Asset Detail]
    O -->|Use in Campaign, deploy permission| P[Hand off to Campaign Launcher]
    O -->|No deploy permission| Q[Disabled button with tooltip]
    O -->|Delete| R[Confirm delete - campaign-link warning]
    O -->|Edit| F
